Wrong. Poison will just make you lose strength and some HP (1d20, IIRC).
So poison will either kill you instantly, or not kill you at all. It
won't kill you in a number of turns.

Also, the ways of curing you describe don't all work for both
afflictions. For example, strength loss by poison can only be cured by
the unicorn horn, while HP loss cannot be cured by aforementioned horn.

